# Copy to .env.local and fill in. Server-side only: never exposed to the browser.
# Powers "Generate with AI" and "Write it with AI" in the editor (dev server).
# DoodleAI 1.0 (vector drawings) works with either key. DoodleAI 2.0 (pictures: 3D, realistic,
# watercolour...) needs a Google AI key with billing turned on; free keys have no image quota.
GEMINI_API_KEY=
APP_SECRET=
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# Optional model overrides:
# GEMINI_IMAGE_MODEL_FAST=gemini-3.1-flash-image
# GEMINI_IMAGE_MODEL_DETAILED=gemini-3-pro-image
